cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."

title: "Blocked Vignette Experiment App"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Lomholt
    given-names: Rune
    affiliation: Københavns Professionshøjskole
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5333-3234 

year: 2025

abstract: >
  An open-source web application for designing and running blocked vignette
  experiments. The app supports researcher-defined blocked designs, dynamic
  loading of vignette sets, attention checks, and export of analysis-ready data.
  Experimental designs and vignette texts are generated externally (e.g. in R),
  while the application handles experimental delivery and data collection.

repository-code: "https://github.com/runehlomholt/vignette-experiment-app"

license: MIT

keywords:
  - vignette experiments
  - blocked designs
  - experimental methods
  - educational research
  - research infrastructure
  - open source
